{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":28687,\"title\":\"Unholy\",\"tagline\":\"Beware of the experiment...\",\"overview\":\"Martha, a widow living in rural Pennsylvania, comes home to find her daughter about to blow her own head off with a shotgun in the basement of their house. Martha doesn't succeed in stopping her child's horrific demise, but the girl's death gradually leads the grieving mother to investigate a conspiracy that involves a legendary local witch, Nazi dabbling with the occult, and secret government experiments, with the story even referencing the fabled Philadelphia Experiment\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h8tqQwS0gEGFfv4vUDRBhUuWBHM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":3.4,\"voteCount\":13,\"year\":2007,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":250000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Daryl Goldberg\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":101627,\"name\":\"Daryl Goldberg\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":11782,\"name\":\"Adrienne Barbeau\",\"character\":\"Martha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ynTQRao9YeH6dmUbuUWFzE5r1Wq.jpg\"},{\"id\":71675,\"name\":\"Nicholas Brendon\",\"character\":\"Lucas\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6O5sg97Fv07EzdWjpoq3lb8KnTM.jpg\"},{\"id\":99814,\"name\":\"Siri Baruc\",\"character\":\"Hope\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p2hcNaIxEfinrmDYTVrit7KzihS.jpg\"},{\"id\":101631,\"name\":\"Richard Ziman\",\"character\":\"Store Owner\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xAC08GQbPAt9K0puQFWBoZndpKW.jpg\"},{\"id\":122247,\"name\":\"Cheyenne Casebier\",\"character\":\"Cammy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lWcmaP1oNJ2Ta7xFFdTnaluisv.jpg\"},{\"id\":130724,\"name\":\"Merwin Goldsmith\",\"character\":\"Charlie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bFM80GZvZVN40pSenZEAgzYeBVh.jpg\"},{\"id\":97267,\"name\":\"Susan Willis\",\"character\":\"Gertrude\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w6FPXoFvs3HwHxERKLFlbdjpnxW.jpg\"},{\"id\":141458,\"name\":\"Joseph McKenna\",\"character\":\"Lester\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2RDyJ2jIS4br56rqqylVZBcEGwK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1719594,\"name\":\"Alan Aisenberg\",\"character\":\"Scotty\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rgmwsg23NnN6bVUKZl6HNsWBT4k.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100988,\"title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":170,\"title\":\"28 Days Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJFwk1clMal1prxAvKAgHxKPAf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it's absolutely impossible to contain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084199,\"title\":\"Companion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sc1abgWNXc29wSBaerrjGBih06l.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a weekend getaway at a secluded lakeside estate, a group of friends finds themselves entangled in a web of secrets, deception, and advanced technology. As tensions rise and loyalties are tested, they uncover unsettling truths about themselves and the world around them.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1064028,\"title\":\"Subservience\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gBenxR01Uy0Ev9RTIw6dVBPoyQU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/co7oxvpWxgd6FZU24DnljDDHYQA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his wife out sick, a struggling father brings home a lifelike AI, only to have his self-aware new help want everything her new family has to offer... Like the affection of her owner and she'll kill to get it.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":520763,\"title\":\"A Quiet Place Part II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4q2hz2m8hubgvijz8Ez0T2Os2Yv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuBYYlbfiYD7ny5VNj46NG14ykR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the events at home, the Abbott family now face the terrors of the outside world. Forced to venture into the unknown, they realize that the creatures that hunt by sound are not the only threats that lurk beyond the sand path.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aRfFP8stzodl0bo8ywoNZXdaVwo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7t6f6VxA2ZXbbZSVctgt7bZG2DI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604079,\"title\":\"The Long Walk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyghveaMeSnTMFKT2ZebfVymhET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5876,\"title\":\"The Mist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c4UgUKZjM0Qzy5t4hAXSOFHYsnb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/76J14zgwVWyOciri7X7F3DGP3TA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158015,\"title\":\"The Purge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x6hwbnR2nGacSzljqYaXY25w1Me.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anFRs7Xi7u2nqqBpmhqvXINAPix.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Given the country's overcrowded prisons, the U.S. government begins to allow 12-hour periods of time in which all illegal activity is legal. During one of these free-for-alls, a family must protect themselves from a home invasion.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9667,\"title\":\"The Jacket\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bt89UfRhjAvJDAO9CWJnRFXAN3p.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMson3ThVDsgHUMbdFFyUdpLU2M.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4723,\"title\":\"Southland Tales\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7dbIDQ80z4bxiDlAvxRwc5TI44C.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oaT5yMG61XetddVmymGrDVeoCg4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Set in the futuristic landscape of Los Angeles on July 4, 2008, as it stands on the brink of social, economic and environmental disaster. Boxer Santaros is an action star who's stricken with amnesia. His life intertwines with Krysta Now, an adult film star developing her own reality television project, and Ronald Taverner, a Hermosa Beach police officer who holds the key to a vast conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"_SlRSUqbW-I\",\"name\":\"unholy 2007 film thrailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url"